329 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 253 0 R
/E (In the context of LLMs, a token is a basic unit of text that the model processes. A token can represent various components of language, including:)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
330 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 798 0 R
